OL,3,GNEWSAGlasgow museums remove mummified
OL,4,Aremains from public view
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo museums in Glasgow have removed the
OL,7,Fremains of Egyptian mummies from
OL,8,Fdisplay over ethical concerns.
OL,10,FThe mummified corpse of the priest
OL,11,FNekht was taken out of public view at
OL,12,FKelvingrove Gallery, while The
OL,13,FHunterian Museum has covered Lady
OL,14,FShep-En-Hor's body in a specially
OL,15,Fdesigned textile to protect it from
OL,16,Fbeing seen by visitors.
OL,18,FThe institutions said the decisions
OL,19,Ffollowed a reassessment of their duty
OL,20,Fof care towards the deceased.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
