OL,3,GNEWSAGlasgow museums remove mummified
OL,4,Aremains from public view
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes after the International
OL,7,FCouncil of Museums (Icom) revised its
OL,8,Fcode of ethics, recommending that the
OL,9,F"inherent dignity" of human remains be
OL,10,Fupheld.
